WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:16.416
the fairy wind's mischief, Ellen was never left alone.

2
00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:20.479
Everyone held her tightly so she couldn't float away.

3
00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.942
She was tied to her bed and carriage.

4
00:00:24.643 --> 00:00:26.445
She was carried everywhere.

5
00:00:27.726 --> 00:00:29.888
Her poor parents couldn't stop worrying.

6
00:00:32.068 --> 00:00:34.210
One day the king was counting his money.

7
00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:41.415
gold coins have weight," he thought sadly.

8
00:00:41.435 --> 00:00:44.517
"Yet my daughter weighs nothing at all."

9
00:00:44.537 --> 00:00:48.520
A moment later the king heard someone crying.

10
00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.381
It was the queen.

11
00:00:51.902 --> 00:00:53.223
The king hurried to her.

12
00:00:53.243 --> 00:00:56.565
"What's wrong, my queen?"

13
00:00:56.585 --> 00:01:00.468
"It's our child," the queen said.

14
00:01:01.056 --> 00:01:02.917
"Ellen is so light.

15
00:01:03.378 --> 00:01:04.939
What if we lose her again?"

16
00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:06.520
She blew her nose.

17
00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:11.563
"It's a big worry," the king said glumly.

18
00:01:11.583 --> 00:01:16.086
"And what will happen when Ellen gets married and has children?

19
00:01:16.727 --> 00:01:19.629
Our kingdom will be filled with floating babies!"

20
00:01:19.649 --> 00:01:25.332
"I have an idea," the queen said slowly.

21
00:01:26.473 --> 00:01:27.474
The king smiled.

22
00:01:27.494 --> 00:01:30.456
"You always have good ideas, my queen.

23
00:01:30.996 --> 00:01:31.877
What is this one?"

24
00:01:32.797 --> 00:01:35.839
"You could visit your sister," she said.

25
00:01:36.699 --> 00:01:38.520
The king coughed nervously.

26
00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:42.502
"Visit Lady Agnes?"

27
00:01:42.522 --> 00:01:47.005
"Yes. Tell her we're sorry.

28
00:01:47.505 --> 00:01:51.227
We didn't mean to forget her invitation," the queen said.

29
00:01:51.247 --> 00:01:55.209
"And then you must beg her to remove the spell.

30
00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:56.770
Please, dear!"

31
00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:05.335
The king sighed and patted his wife's shoulder.

32
00:02:05.355 --> 00:02:07.356
"Dry your tears.

33
00:02:07.956 --> 00:02:08.917
I'll go tomorrow."

34
00:02:12.239 --> 00:02:15.561
The next morning the king went to visit Lady Agnes.

35
00:02:16.941 --> 00:02:18.162
A servant brought tea.

36
00:02:23.005 --> 00:02:25.746
er The king fumbled with his napkin.

37
00:02:25.766 --> 00:02:28.288
"I hope you're well, Agnes.

38
00:02:29.212 --> 00:02:31.174
I came to talk to you about something important."

39
00:02:32.334 --> 00:02:33.815
Agnes narrowed her eyes.

40
00:02:33.835 --> 00:02:40.420
"Yes?" "It's the spell," the king said.

41
00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:43.702
"You were angry I forgot to invite you to the baptism.

42
00:02:44.182 --> 00:02:45.904
So you put a spell on Ellen.

43
00:02:46.164 --> 00:02:50.027
And now the princess is—" "A spell?"

44
00:02:53.889 --> 00:02:55.390
Agnes laughed loudly.

45
00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.712
"How ridiculous!

46
00:02:58.624 --> 00:03:02.026
As usual, you're much too impatient, brother.

47
00:03:03.027 --> 00:03:06.889
Your silly daughter will grow out of her lightness someday.

48
00:03:06.969 --> 00:03:11.532
You just need to be patient—and mend your ways."

49
00:03:11.552 --> 00:03:14.453
"Mend my ways?"

50
00:03:14.854 --> 00:03:15.594
the king said.

51
00:03:15.614 --> 00:03:16.855
"What do you mean?"

52
00:03:16.875 --> 00:03:23.038
"Work on being a better person," Agnes sneered.

53
00:03:23.058 --> 00:03:25.420
"I'll tell you where to start.

54
00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:29.883
Treat your older sister with more respect!"
